{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"thomas-haden-church","name":"Thomas Haden Church","birthDate":"1960-06-17","birthPlace":"Yolo County, California, USA","bio":"Thomas Haden Church (born Thomas Richard McMillen; June 17, 1960) is an American actor. After starring in the 1990s sitcom Wings and playing the lead for two seasons in Ned & Stacey (1995–1997), Church became known for his film work, including his role of Lyle van de Groot in George of the Jungle (1997), his Academy Award-nominated performance in Sideways (2004), his role as the Marvel Comics villain Sandman in the superhero films Spider-Man 3 (2007) and Spider-Man: No Way Home (2021), as well as his starring roles in Over the Hedge (2006), Smart People (2008), Easy A (2010), We Bought a Zoo (2011), Max (2015), and Hellboy (2019). He also made his directorial debut with Rolling Kansas (2003). In 2023, he starred as antagonist Agent Stone in the post-apocalyptic action comedy series Twisted Metal.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Thomas Haden Church, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:30:27+00:00","tmdbId":19159,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/19159","credits":[{"id":"spider-no","title":"Spider-Man: No Way Home","character":"Flint Marko / Sandman"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/thomas-haden-church.webp","filmography":[{"name":"A Dog's Perfect Christmas","year":2026,"character":"Winstead (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zvsNAohDHRWcGvbPSD7r3WojpKb.jpg"},{"name":"The Legend of the Happy Worker","year":2025,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hO3MYYdovMqkxAjTb0K9pTgMDyq.jpg"},{"name":"Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery","year":2025,"character":"Samson Holt","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iV9LM8aUb83BjCCx2RUnKE5sSQg.jpg"},{"name":"Accidental Texan","year":2024,"character":"Merle","mediaType":"movie